@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> Off
Off --> ActiveAlarm : Set Alarm Time
ActiveAlarm --> RingingAlarm : Match Current Time with Alarm Time
RingingAlarm --> StoppedAlarm : Turn off Alarm / Stop Ringing
StoppedAlarm --> ActiveAlarm : Next Scheduled Alarm Time
ActiveAlarm --> [*]
RingingAlarm --> [*]
StoppedAlarm --> [*]
@enduml
